      statement: "hypergumbo compact silently accepts --max-symbols 0 (produces 1 node), --max-symbols -5 (output unclear), --coverage 2.0 (out of documented 0.0-1.0 range; returns 100 nodes = default max), --coverage -1 (negative; returns 100 nodes). No clamping warning, no rejection. Same input-validation pattern as PP/QQ/RR/III/X (compact silent invalid flags filed pass 5, this extends to numeric values)."  # 3310
      root_cause: "Compact CLI arg parsing accepts raw int/float without bounds-checking."  # 3310
